        "name": "Ijen Rijik: The Monthly Closure Day at Kawah Ijen",
        "description": "Ijen closes on the first Friday of every month for Rijik cleanup. See how JVTO schedules Ijen-inclusive tours around this closure.",
        "url": "https://javavolcano-touroperator.com/travel-guide/rijik-monthly-closure",
